WEBVTT

00:18.990 --> 00:22.690
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:22.960 --> 00:28.190
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.370 --> 00:33.900
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:34.070 --> 00:39.240
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.410 --> 00:44.680
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:44.980 --> 00:50.420
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.620 --> 00:56.060
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.230 --> 01:01.490
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.700 --> 01:09.400
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:29.330 --> 01:31.850
What a lovely moon tonight.

01:32.230 --> 01:33.990
It's howl-worthy.

01:36.470 --> 01:40.230
Those goddamned snotnosed kids!

01:40.340 --> 01:43.100
Ojou? Why's she pissed
on a night like this?

01:46.140 --> 01:48.980
They're just freakin' messing around!

01:49.980 --> 01:52.210
Ojou? Something wrong?

01:53.080 --> 01:55.920
Ugh! Grading papers, huh?

01:56.190 --> 01:58.380
I don't even want to look at those.

01:58.490 --> 02:00.460
Especially what you're
teaching 'em... figures, right?

02:00.620 --> 02:01.750
Mathematics!

02:01.890 --> 02:03.950
What's the difference?

02:04.130 --> 02:05.990
I'm terrible with numbers.

02:06.630 --> 02:09.900
There isn't a goddamned
number to be seen!

02:10.230 --> 02:11.130
What the...

02:11.800 --> 02:12.890
This one...

02:13.070 --> 02:14.040
And this one...

02:14.370 --> 02:16.270
And this one and this!

02:16.570 --> 02:17.630
What the hell is this?

02:17.740 --> 02:19.040
Just a bunch of scribbles!

02:19.140 --> 02:21.270
Nobody's taking it seriously.

02:21.440 --> 02:24.380
Hey, this one shows two dogs doing it!

02:28.650 --> 02:31.180
It's not freakin' funny!

02:33.160 --> 02:34.920
Damn them!

02:35.060 --> 02:36.920
They're gonna pay for this!

02:39.030 --> 02:40.330
Yes, hello?

02:40.660 --> 02:42.260
Oh, Yasue-Neesan.

02:42.500 --> 02:43.160
What?

02:43.430 --> 02:44.630
What happened?

02:45.440 --> 02:50.400
<i>KUMA'S FIRST TIME?</i>

02:50.540 --> 02:52.670
<i>Club YASUE</i>

02:54.780 --> 02:56.470
What the hell did you say, bitch?

02:56.580 --> 02:58.070
Try saying that again!

02:58.180 --> 03:00.120
Sure, I'll say it as
many times as you want!

03:00.220 --> 03:03.520
You're causing trouble for the other
guests, so you need to get the hell out!

03:03.690 --> 03:06.590
Bitch, is that any way
to talk to your customers?

03:11.330 --> 03:13.060
Kaede-chan, that's enough.

03:13.160 --> 03:15.290
What do you think
you're doing, you little punk?

03:17.870 --> 03:18.730
You...

03:21.170 --> 03:22.730
...friggin' bitch!

03:30.610 --> 03:32.640
What the hell...

03:34.950 --> 03:36.210
Ojou!

03:36.590 --> 03:38.150
Hey, big guy.

03:38.290 --> 03:41.220
Gonna take a swing at her
with this, are you?

03:41.420 --> 03:43.720
Don't you think
that's going a bit too far?

03:49.600 --> 03:50.970
You little whore!

03:53.740 --> 03:54.700
Ouch!

03:55.100 --> 03:56.330
Shit!

03:56.470 --> 03:58.000
Now who's going too friggin' far...

03:58.540 --> 04:00.070
Ow!

04:00.210 --> 04:05.340
Hey, that's no way to talk to
the Ooedo Clan's Acting Kumicho!

04:05.450 --> 04:06.110
Huh?

04:06.220 --> 04:07.450
Ooedo Clan?

04:07.650 --> 04:09.180
Acting Kumicho?

04:10.750 --> 04:12.020
Tetsu, Fuji.

04:12.220 --> 04:16.630
Teach these boys some
table manners, will you?

04:16.730 --> 04:17.320
Right!

04:18.930 --> 04:21.420
Come on, we don't want
to mess up the bar.

04:21.530 --> 04:23.560
Let's take this outside!

04:24.370 --> 04:26.390
Ojou, you were so tough!

04:26.500 --> 04:27.990
Is everyone all right?

04:29.670 --> 04:32.610
Um, thank you so much.

04:33.080 --> 04:35.200
Hey, no problem.

04:37.010 --> 04:38.480
How can I thank you?

04:38.580 --> 04:41.140
You really know how to kick butt, Ojou.

04:41.250 --> 04:43.650
Oh, please. They were
a couple of candyasses.

04:43.820 --> 04:45.620
I owe you big time, Ojou.

04:45.760 --> 04:48.020
Well, Nee-san,
it's fine to be ballsy, but...

04:48.220 --> 04:51.160
...you shoudn't push it, or
you might really get hurt next time.

04:51.590 --> 04:55.660
I know that, but that's
just the way I am.

04:56.030 --> 04:58.900
I don't think I've seen you before.
Did you start here recently?

04:59.340 --> 05:01.030
Yes, last month.

05:01.170 --> 05:04.000
My name is Sayuri.
Thanks for your patronage.

05:04.140 --> 05:09.140
Ojou, Sayuri is
raising her son by herself.

05:09.380 --> 05:12.140
Wow, that's a lot of work.

05:12.920 --> 05:15.780
I used to have my own small bar...

05:15.890 --> 05:18.650
...but it went under
because of the recession.

05:19.190 --> 05:21.950
I'm not getting any younger,
so I didn't know where to turn.

05:22.060 --> 05:24.650
But then Yasue stepped
in and gave me this job.

05:24.730 --> 05:27.200
You're a big help to me too, you know.

05:27.300 --> 05:29.460
You're practically
running the place now!

05:29.530 --> 05:31.630
Oh no, I wouldn't say that.

05:31.770 --> 05:32.600
Neesan.

05:33.540 --> 05:35.840
Haven't we met before?

05:36.010 --> 05:36.500
Huh?

05:36.610 --> 05:37.630
Oh, no.

05:37.740 --> 05:40.040
If we'd met, I'm sure
I would remember you.

05:40.180 --> 05:41.970
I guess that's true.

05:42.280 --> 05:44.650
But you do look familiar.

05:46.180 --> 05:47.620
Oh well, it doesn't matter.

05:47.850 --> 05:50.180
Well then, Yasue-Neesan,
I'll be going.

05:50.690 --> 05:52.620
Thank you again for your help!

05:52.720 --> 05:54.780
I'll leave Tetsu with you, just in case.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.830
Ojou, please come again.

05:56.960 --> 05:57.620
Sure.

05:59.830 --> 06:02.060
So she's from the Ooedo clan...

06:02.400 --> 06:04.490
I owe her my life.

06:13.980 --> 06:16.640
What the hell?
She looks really pissed.

06:17.450 --> 06:19.280
You could kill with that look, teach.

06:19.380 --> 06:21.320
Hey, yo, what's up your butt?

06:23.550 --> 06:25.780
I'm handing back your mid-terms.

06:25.990 --> 06:27.080
Who wants 'em!

06:27.220 --> 06:30.790
Oh, is that why you have
that look on your face?

06:31.290 --> 06:34.860
Um, the person with the highest
score of 98 was Shin Sawada.

06:35.370 --> 06:37.200
Way to go, Shin-chan!

06:37.300 --> 06:38.290
Screw that.

06:38.400 --> 06:41.370
Hey, where the hell
did you take points off?

06:42.310 --> 06:45.540
You forgot to put down the units.
Deciliter, see?

06:45.710 --> 06:48.140
Damn! Is this revenge for the other day?

06:48.280 --> 06:50.270
You think I'd pull something that petty?

06:50.380 --> 06:52.440
Next, Kubo-kun. A 75!

06:52.580 --> 06:53.910
Crap, Yankumi.

06:54.150 --> 06:58.020
You're not going to broadcast
everyone's grades like that, are you?

06:58.550 --> 07:01.850
Fat chance. The rest are too
pathetic to utter out loud!

07:02.090 --> 07:04.250
The class average was 21.

07:04.660 --> 07:08.830
A whopping 12 out of 18
of you flunked by scoring below 30!

07:09.100 --> 07:12.160
I'm your math teacher, as
well as your homeroom teacher.

07:12.300 --> 07:13.860
This is a disgrace!

07:14.140 --> 07:16.440
Well, we can't help
it if we don't get it!

07:17.210 --> 07:19.470
Everyone who flunked has to
take a make-up test next month.

07:19.580 --> 07:21.010
What? Are you serious?

07:21.110 --> 07:23.640
It's just gonna be the
same thing over again!

07:23.980 --> 07:26.010
That's why I'm going to
have all you flunkers...

07:26.120 --> 07:28.680
...stay after school
for remedial classes.

07:28.820 --> 07:29.750
What the hell?

07:29.890 --> 07:30.790
Are you crazy, bitch?

07:30.890 --> 07:32.360
You can't do that to us!

07:32.560 --> 07:35.220
Excuse me, but with grades like this,
not only won't you get a job...

07:35.320 --> 07:36.950
...but you're not even
going to graduate, either.

07:37.090 --> 07:37.860
Who gives a crap!

07:37.990 --> 07:40.990
We're not trying to get into
a freakin' Fortune 500 company!

07:41.100 --> 07:48.160
Math ain't gonna help us get jobs
in the local shops or factories.

07:49.010 --> 07:54.670
Which shop or factory is going to hire
someone who can't even add and subtract?

07:56.310 --> 07:57.580
Goddammit!

07:58.650 --> 08:01.910
All right, fine!
I'll just become a gangster!

08:04.050 --> 08:05.110
Not a bad idea!

08:05.220 --> 08:06.420
I can see that happening...

08:08.190 --> 08:09.120
Is that so?

08:09.390 --> 08:11.590
You're just gonna become a gangster?

08:14.660 --> 08:16.060
Huh?

08:17.070 --> 08:19.800
Don't freakin' insult gangsters!

08:20.600 --> 08:25.300
I'd like to see such a lamebrain,
butt-ugly, jerkoff punk who's a wuss...

08:25.580 --> 08:28.910
...who also has no spine,
no guts and no balls...

08:29.050 --> 08:30.780
...become a gangster!

08:31.380 --> 08:33.750
Hey you! Are you talking about me?

08:33.850 --> 08:34.780
No matter which clan...

08:34.880 --> 08:38.120
...takes you in, you'll never be
more than an expendable hatchetman.

08:38.250 --> 08:42.020
Even if they boil you to death, or
leave you floating in some harbor!

08:42.190 --> 08:45.990
You wouldn't even rate
a mention in the tabloids!

08:55.300 --> 08:58.210
Just kidding!

08:58.410 --> 09:00.380
Did I sound like one?
You know, like a Godmother...

09:00.480 --> 09:01.710
Did I sound like one?

09:01.880 --> 09:02.780
Are you a complete moron?

09:02.950 --> 09:04.380
You didn't sound anything like one!

09:05.310 --> 09:06.480
Well, anyway, there you go.

09:06.580 --> 09:09.280
We'll be starting today, so if you
flunked, please see me after school...

09:09.390 --> 09:10.110
We're done!

09:12.360 --> 09:13.650
Jeez, not good, not good!

09:13.820 --> 09:15.720
I can't get carried away like that...

09:15.860 --> 09:17.330
That was really close!

09:18.360 --> 09:21.160
That was pretty intense just now.

09:21.360 --> 09:22.460
Dammit.

09:22.670 --> 09:24.960
No way are we showing up
for remedial classes!

09:25.070 --> 09:26.230
Right, Uchi?

09:28.200 --> 09:29.730
Huh? What?

09:31.140 --> 09:32.540
<i>Haruhiko Uchiyama</i>

09:33.280 --> 09:34.210
Sorry.

09:34.310 --> 09:36.340
Goddamn you, you traitor!

09:36.480 --> 09:37.610
Hey, Kuma.

09:38.280 --> 09:40.310
I did better than I thought.

09:40.750 --> 09:42.950
You're skipping the
remedial classes, right?

09:43.090 --> 09:43.610
Right?

09:43.720 --> 09:45.620
Right. No way am I going!

09:45.720 --> 09:47.280
You're the man!

09:50.690 --> 09:51.290
What?

09:51.390 --> 09:52.790
Remedial math classes?

09:53.330 --> 09:55.660
Their mid-term scores were atrocious.

09:55.830 --> 09:59.460
I'm going to start with basic arithmetic
and get them back up to speed.

09:59.570 --> 10:02.370
Wow, you've got your
work cut out for you!

10:02.610 --> 10:06.340
But I like the sound of
"extracurricular classes." It's rather...

10:07.040 --> 10:10.040
Useless, useless.
You're wasting your time.

10:10.680 --> 10:15.350
No one has ever succeeded in giving
remedial classes at this school...

10:15.890 --> 10:19.750
We can barely get them
to come to regular class!

10:20.020 --> 10:21.720
But, Vice Principal...

10:21.820 --> 10:26.130
...being in touch with the students
after school is a good use of our time.

10:26.230 --> 10:29.560
I've started a choir club myself.

10:29.730 --> 10:32.730
Actually, there are no members yet.

10:32.840 --> 10:36.140
But one of these days it's going to
have the best-looking boys in the...

10:36.240 --> 10:39.000
I mean, the best-sounding boys
in the district! You'll see!

10:39.440 --> 10:40.670
Those delinquents...

10:40.780 --> 10:42.470
...in a boys' choir?

10:55.560 --> 10:56.690
Hmm...

10:56.930 --> 11:00.330
I thought at least two or three
of them would show up...

11:00.530 --> 11:02.500
Not even the tabloids, she says.

11:02.600 --> 11:04.530
She's got a lot of nerve, that bitch.

11:04.830 --> 11:05.800
Right, Kuma?

11:05.900 --> 11:06.600
Uh-huh.

11:06.740 --> 11:10.260
I thought she was just a crazy teacher,
but then she has to butt in!

11:10.370 --> 11:11.340
Right, Kuma?

11:11.440 --> 11:12.340
Uh-huh.

11:12.440 --> 11:14.770
Who the hell would go
to remedial classes?

11:14.880 --> 11:15.850
Right, Kuma?

11:16.010 --> 11:16.540
Uh-huh.

11:21.580 --> 11:22.280
What?

11:26.020 --> 11:28.650
Yankumi is actually waiting!

11:29.390 --> 11:30.830
Is she retarded?

11:30.960 --> 11:31.550
Yeah.

11:31.690 --> 11:33.690
Just ignore Yankumi, guys, ignore her!

11:33.800 --> 11:36.060
The tabloids? I should be so lucky!

11:36.170 --> 11:37.790
Come on, let's get something to eat.

11:37.900 --> 11:40.430
Yeah, how about beef bowls at Yoshinoya?

11:43.770 --> 11:44.970
What's up? Yo!

11:45.070 --> 11:46.740
Morning.

11:49.350 --> 11:51.680
Oh well, it was only the first day.
I should've known!

11:51.910 --> 11:53.040
All right! Tomorrow...

11:53.150 --> 11:56.950
Excuse me, do you know where
I can find Ms. Yamaguchi of Class 2-4?

11:57.050 --> 11:57.710
No idea.

11:57.820 --> 11:58.750
Who's that, anyway?

11:59.690 --> 12:01.620
Uh, can I help you?

12:07.060 --> 12:09.620
Ooedo's Ojou!

12:15.740 --> 12:16.430
Kuma!

12:16.540 --> 12:17.670
Kuma, you there?

12:19.010 --> 12:24.140
Yankumi just grabbed your mom
by the throat and took off with her!

12:24.550 --> 12:26.380
What?

12:27.580 --> 12:29.810
What the hell!

12:37.890 --> 12:39.860
Wow, I nearly had a heart attack.

12:40.300 --> 12:41.700
Yeah, me, too.

12:41.900 --> 12:44.800
Sayuri, so you're Kuma's mother!

12:45.000 --> 12:48.100
I knew I'd seen you somewhere before.

12:48.240 --> 12:49.430
He takes after you.

12:49.540 --> 12:51.700
I was really shocked!

12:51.870 --> 12:55.740
I'd heard from Yasue
that you were teaching...

12:55.980 --> 12:59.350
...but I never dreamed you were
my son's homeroom teacher!

12:59.480 --> 13:01.040
What a small world...

13:01.180 --> 13:03.050
Anyway, what brings you here today?

13:03.150 --> 13:04.310
Oh, that's right.

13:04.620 --> 13:07.650
I came to pay my son's back tuition.

13:08.220 --> 13:10.890
I didn't want to have Teruo bring it in.

13:11.460 --> 13:15.300
Yasue gave me a big bonus,
so now I can finally pay.

13:15.800 --> 13:16.600
I see.

13:16.700 --> 13:17.930
That's really great.

13:18.070 --> 13:20.300
But Ojou, you're really amazing.

13:20.600 --> 13:23.130
You're holding down this teaching job...

13:23.310 --> 13:26.500
Well, I'm just a rookie,
so I'm not really sure if I'm...

13:26.610 --> 13:29.510
And then after school, you have
to take care of clan business...

13:29.610 --> 13:30.310
Sayuri!

13:30.910 --> 13:33.540
Not a word about that here...

13:33.680 --> 13:35.670
R-Right, I know!

13:35.820 --> 13:39.190
Wild horses couldn't drag it
out of me, not even to Teruo!

13:39.320 --> 13:41.550
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

13:44.590 --> 13:46.030
Shin-chan?

13:46.300 --> 13:49.320
Such a pain in the ass!

13:50.400 --> 13:52.870
Mrs. Kumai, is she an
acquaintance of yours?

13:53.540 --> 13:56.010
Oh, please! She's much
more than that to me!

13:56.140 --> 13:58.610
These thugs were
pushing me around, and...

13:59.180 --> 14:00.110
Yankumi!

14:00.210 --> 14:01.510
That's really low of you!

14:02.550 --> 14:05.880
Attacking my mother just because
I didn't show up for your remedial class?

14:05.980 --> 14:07.040
You call yourself a teacher...

14:07.150 --> 14:07.810
Ow!

14:07.980 --> 14:09.450
You little idiot!

14:09.590 --> 14:13.180
Don't talk like that to the person
who saved your mother's life!

14:13.390 --> 14:14.950
Saved your life?

14:15.060 --> 14:19.260
Your teacher saved me when I was
about to get my head cracked open...

14:19.360 --> 14:20.590
...with a bottle by a drunkard!

14:20.930 --> 14:21.630
Huh?

14:21.860 --> 14:23.360
Oh, I'm screwed!

14:23.530 --> 14:25.830
Mom, are you imagining things or what?

14:25.940 --> 14:28.770
How the hell could
someone like her save you?

14:28.870 --> 14:31.240
Oh, you have no idea!
She was awesome!

14:31.340 --> 14:32.710
She took a geta and...

14:34.180 --> 14:34.870
Geta?

14:34.980 --> 14:38.880
Uh, well, the geta just
happened to fly by, and uh...

14:38.980 --> 14:42.110
And then there was this guy
with scars all over his face, and...

14:42.250 --> 14:43.690
Then a lot of stuff happened, you know!

14:43.790 --> 14:44.620
No, I don't.

14:44.720 --> 14:45.620
Well, who cares!

14:45.720 --> 14:48.320
Get yourself back to class
and study! Study!

14:48.420 --> 14:50.020
Jeez, what the hell...

14:58.070 --> 14:59.730
So you did do it, didn't you?

14:59.840 --> 15:00.730
I knew it!

15:01.640 --> 15:04.000
What are you talking about, Shin-chan?

15:04.110 --> 15:05.840
You go on back to class, too.

15:10.210 --> 15:13.770
I don't know where his manners are!

15:14.580 --> 15:18.210
But Shin-chan is really
a good boy, you know.

15:18.320 --> 15:20.760
And my Teruo may not be the
brightest light bulb out there...

15:20.890 --> 15:23.360
...but he's definitely no hoodlum.

15:24.060 --> 15:27.550
Most of the kids at this school
have a bad reputation...

15:27.730 --> 15:29.320
But the truth is...

15:29.570 --> 15:32.970
Sayuri, you don't
have to tell me. I know.

15:33.240 --> 15:35.930
I think I have an eye for character.

15:36.110 --> 15:39.230
I don't judge people on their
appearance, or how they talk.

15:39.610 --> 15:41.540
Oh yes, that's right!

15:41.740 --> 15:44.610
That's your area of expertise, right?

15:44.750 --> 15:46.240
Expertise? Well, no...

15:46.420 --> 15:48.350
Ojou, I'm so glad that you're my son's...

15:48.450 --> 15:51.250
Yo, yo, none of that "Ojou" stuff here!

15:51.350 --> 15:53.620
Right, right. That's right.

15:53.760 --> 15:56.620
By the way, what did Teruo
mean about "remedial classes?"

15:57.030 --> 15:58.260
Oh! Well, uh...

15:58.360 --> 16:00.120
You see...

16:01.000 --> 16:02.860
Talk to me, please!

16:06.870 --> 16:08.430
Hey, let's hang out somewhere.

16:08.540 --> 16:09.940
Yeah, good idea.

16:10.470 --> 16:11.840
Huh? Where's Shin?

16:11.940 --> 16:14.640
I don't know, but he said he'd catch up.

16:16.310 --> 16:17.840
What the hell, Minami?

16:18.950 --> 16:22.110
Does Yankumi still have her
heart set on remedial classes?

16:22.550 --> 16:24.610
Oh, hell! As if anybody's gonna show up.

16:24.720 --> 16:25.810
Yeah, you're right!

16:37.400 --> 16:38.030
Hey.

16:39.900 --> 16:41.170
Oh, it's you!

16:41.300 --> 16:42.460
What do you want?

16:42.640 --> 16:46.100
Do you really think
anyone's gonna show up?

16:46.340 --> 16:47.500
Who knows?

16:47.780 --> 16:51.080
But I told them I'd be giving remedial
classes, so I have no choice but to wait.

16:51.180 --> 16:53.620
Otherwise, I wouldn't be
keeping my word to them.

16:54.580 --> 16:58.920
I really can't figure you out...

16:59.150 --> 17:00.280
Hey, wait!

17:00.560 --> 17:03.790
Instead of worrying about the others,
why don't you join the choir club?

17:04.290 --> 17:06.060
Who said I was worrying?

17:06.530 --> 17:08.050
Besides, that choir club has...

17:08.200 --> 17:11.000
...even less a chance of happening
than your remedial classes!

17:12.000 --> 17:14.940
Well, can't argue with that...

17:15.200 --> 17:19.610
Ms. Fujiyama has a lot
more guts than I thought.

17:20.140 --> 17:23.110
<i>Welcome!</i>
<i>The Choir Club!</i>

17:31.190 --> 17:32.550
Oh! Come on in!

17:32.920 --> 17:35.220
Let's sing our hearts out together!

17:37.290 --> 17:40.420
That makes 12 in a row I've lost.

17:45.500 --> 17:46.630
I'm home.

17:47.600 --> 17:49.160
I've been waiting for you!

17:49.340 --> 17:50.770
What the hell, Mom!

17:50.910 --> 17:52.670
Shouldn't you be at work?

17:52.880 --> 17:55.740
There's something I want to ask you.

17:57.810 --> 18:00.310
Tell me about these remedial classes!

18:00.420 --> 18:03.580
So Yankumi squealed on me, didn't she?

18:03.690 --> 18:05.020
You idiot, shut up!

18:05.150 --> 18:06.090
Ojou...

18:06.490 --> 18:11.050
Your teacher just laughed and
changed the subject when I asked!

18:11.190 --> 18:11.990
What?

18:12.800 --> 18:14.260
That Yankumi...

18:14.600 --> 18:16.620
Now, tell me the truth...

18:16.830 --> 18:19.300
Although I have a pretty
good idea already...

18:19.400 --> 18:20.300
Hey, Mom...

18:20.400 --> 18:21.530
No!

18:23.410 --> 18:25.470
Kuma, what happened?

18:26.010 --> 18:28.480
Who beat you up?
Was it a senior?

18:29.380 --> 18:30.180
No.

18:30.650 --> 18:31.840
It was my mom.

18:32.080 --> 18:34.180
Huh? Your mom?

18:34.280 --> 18:35.980
She found out about
the remedial classes.

18:36.090 --> 18:38.820
Your mom can really pack a punch, huh?

18:38.920 --> 18:39.790
That's embarrassing!

18:39.960 --> 18:42.860
She saved my life.

18:43.130 --> 18:45.490
She hit me once, too.

18:45.590 --> 18:47.120
I'm laughing so hard
I'm gonna bust a gut!

18:47.730 --> 18:48.660
Hey, look!

18:48.800 --> 18:51.360
I was thinking of something
like this for the choir club...

18:51.500 --> 18:52.800
You know, like musical theater.

18:53.100 --> 18:55.130
I-I think it's a good choice.

18:55.240 --> 18:56.100
Very unique!

18:56.210 --> 18:59.870
Well, there's no one
to wear it yet, though.

19:00.110 --> 19:01.740
Oops, time for choir club!

19:03.480 --> 19:05.540
She just won't quit, will she!

19:06.010 --> 19:07.980
I guess I should get going too...

19:08.080 --> 19:09.520
Useless! It's useless.

19:16.020 --> 19:18.430
Kuma, what's wrong?

19:19.860 --> 19:23.160
I'm gonna go to the remedial class.

19:23.600 --> 19:24.730
What the hell?

19:24.870 --> 19:28.930
Loser, aren't you a little old
to be scared of your mom?

19:29.040 --> 19:31.400
That's not it, guys!

19:31.610 --> 19:34.010
It's just that she...

19:37.980 --> 19:39.240
Yankumi...

19:39.550 --> 19:41.140
I'm not really sure how...

19:41.480 --> 19:44.150
...but she saved my mom's life...

19:44.250 --> 19:45.050
Huh?

19:45.550 --> 19:47.850
Math is a lot of bullshit, but...

19:48.020 --> 19:51.790
...if I don't show up for her,
I'm not keeping my word, see?

19:53.800 --> 19:55.890
Do whatever the hell you want.

19:56.000 --> 19:57.690
We're going home.

19:58.200 --> 19:59.330
Let's go.

19:59.940 --> 20:02.730
I think I'll pop in for a while, too.

20:02.840 --> 20:03.740
What?

20:03.940 --> 20:07.240
Well, she's been waiting
around for two days.

20:07.380 --> 20:09.680
I don't wanna have to owe her...

20:09.780 --> 20:12.180
You retard, no one
asked her to wait around!

20:12.280 --> 20:13.720
You don't owe her anything!

20:14.350 --> 20:16.680
Well, I'm still going.

20:17.390 --> 20:19.220
I don't believe this.

20:19.320 --> 20:20.910
It's just math! Math!

20:21.020 --> 20:22.720
Who the hell would go, right?

20:23.630 --> 20:25.220
Well...

20:25.530 --> 20:28.520
We don't have to go, you see.

20:28.800 --> 20:30.030
Dammit!

20:30.130 --> 20:33.470
All right, all right!
I should just go, is that it?

20:33.570 --> 20:35.730
Good luck!

20:36.540 --> 20:39.010
Uchi, let me just say this.

20:39.140 --> 20:41.040
Maybe you passed, but you still have...

20:41.140 --> 20:43.240
...miles to go before
you can catch up to Shin!

20:43.450 --> 20:44.500
Yeah, whatever.

20:44.650 --> 20:46.110
Just get your ass to class, will you?

20:46.250 --> 20:47.740
Crap!

20:51.250 --> 20:54.490
So she did get her class...

20:59.460 --> 21:01.190
Hey, wake the hell up!

21:03.670 --> 21:04.630
Yo!

21:05.070 --> 21:06.040
Hey!

21:09.810 --> 21:11.170
Just so you know...

21:11.270 --> 21:15.440
I gave up on math ever since those
goddamn fractions came on the scene.

21:15.880 --> 21:18.070
The effin' times tables
were my downfall.

21:18.210 --> 21:19.110
Got that?

21:19.550 --> 21:22.140
I'll stick around, but
I don't plan on listening.

21:23.020 --> 21:25.150
What did you guys come here for?

21:26.620 --> 21:27.890
Ojou...

21:29.190 --> 21:32.890
All your efforts paid off in the end.

21:33.330 --> 21:38.060
You managed to get those dimwits
to attend your remedial classes.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.900
I'm sure a lot of good will come...

21:40.000 --> 21:41.160
Grr!

21:41.300 --> 21:42.400
<i>See you next year!</i>

21:43.710 --> 21:44.670
<i>I wanna eat Ramen</i>

21:44.810 --> 21:45.870
<i>GLAY</i>

21:46.110 --> 21:49.600
What the hell good did
those remedial classes do!

21:50.110 --> 21:52.640
I'm gonna kill them!

22:06.900 --> 22:16.890
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:17.970 --> 22:27.870
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:28.680 --> 22:38.620
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:48.790
<i>On those days when I am alone and cold</i>
<i>I'll light a fire with my own two hands.</i>

22:49.340 --> 22:59.340
<i>Treacherous mountains are my chosen path.</i>
<i>I'll move forward without a backward glance.</i>

23:17.900 --> 23:22.960
In the Gokudo world, we look out
for the weak and thwart the strong.

23:23.110 --> 23:25.270
That's the Way of the Gokudo!

23:25.440 --> 23:29.670
No student of Ojou's would stoop to
something as petty as purse-snatching!

23:29.780 --> 23:33.110
Not even if hell froze over!

23:33.280 --> 23:35.340
I'd stake my life on it.

23:35.480 --> 23:40.010
Next Episode:
Ojou Goes Blond! Whodunnit?

23:40.290 --> 23:43.520
Ojou, give it all you've got!

23:43.630 --> 23:45.320
<i>Ojou Goes Blond! Whodunnit?</i>
